  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="source-image" n="Upper cover" facs="#surface-c01" xml:id="c01">
        <note type="layout">外封面；展覽貼簽、手寫館藏記號不屬本次原作印字層。</note>
        <note type="layout-reviewed">true</note>
        <note type="layer-states">{}</note>
      </div>
      <div type="source-image" n="Inside upper cover and p. [1]" facs="#surface-c02" xml:id="c02">
        <note type="layout">左面為原刊扉頁、題名與刊記；右面封裡空白。後加英文字與手寫年份不轉錄。</note>
        <note type="layout-reviewed">true</note>
        <note type="layer-states">{"original-print": "complete"}</note>
        <ab type="title" n="left" facs="#surface-c02" xml:id="c02-L01">咸豐九年新鍥</ab>
        <ab type="title" n="left" facs="#surface-c02" xml:id="c02-L02">論發冷小腸疝兩症</ab>
        <ab type="title" n="left" facs="#surface-c02" xml:id="c02-L03">博濟醫局藏板</ab>
        <note type="transcription-uncertainty" target="#c02-L01" corresp="uncertainties.json#c02-controller-unc" xml:id="c02-controller-unc">{"candidates": ["鍥", "鐫"], "cause": "reading-unresolved", "end": 6, "extent": "located-unit", "id": "c02-controller-unc", "position_note": "整單位疑讀；非逐字位置認證。", "reason": "刊年後末字的金旁右部須進一步回圖核實；保留初錄讀法。", "start": 0, "surface": "咸豐九年新鍥", "unit_id": "c02-L01"}</note>
      </div>
      <div type="source-image" n="pp. [2]-[3]" facs="#surface-c03" xml:id="c03">
        <note type="layout">右面為扉頁背面透印及藏章，不重複錄透印；左面宗教前言起首，右側近裝訂處有局部印墨與遮邊。</note>
        <note type="layout-reviewed">true</note>
        <note type="layer-states">{"original-print": "complete"}</note>
        <ab type="preface" n="left" facs="#surface-c03" xml:id="c03-L01">嘗思天道福善禍淫、疾病死亡、所以報惡</ab>
        <ab type="preface" n="left" facs="#surface-c03" xml:id="c03-L02">者也、初天地闢時、亞當夏娃二人違</ab>
        <ab type="preface" n="left" facs="#surface-c03" xml:id="c03-L03">天父命、食禁果、罪惡由此始、厥後苗裔因</ab>
        <ab type="preface" n="left" facs="#surface-c03" xml:id="c03-L04">有罪惡、既有罪惡、當受懲罰、　　天父特</ab>
        <ab type="preface" n="left" facs="#surface-c03" xml:id="c03-L05">降以死亡、疾病、懲惡罰罪、使人悔改、此意、</ab>
        <ab type="preface" n="left" facs="#surface-c03" xml:id="c03-L06">非無足據、昔保羅曰、且以一人在世有罪、</ab>
        <ab type="preface" n="left" facs="#surface-c03" xml:id="c03-L07">因罪而死、又曰、罪惡之償値、乃死、蓋禍難</ab>
        <ab type="preface" n="left" facs="#surface-c03" xml:id="c03-L08">由於罪惡、然罪惡之報、不徒在於今生、更</ab>
        <ab type="preface" n="left" facs="#surface-c03" xml:id="c03-L09">在於世界末日、故見人有禍難、在己貴以</ab>
        <note type="transcription-uncertainty" target="#c03-L07" corresp="uncertainties.json#c03-unc-01" xml:id="c03-unc-01">{"candidates": ["乃", "亡"], "cause": "reading-unresolved", "end": 20, "extent": "located-unit", "id": "c03-unc-01", "position_note": "初錄疑讀以整個定位單位標記，未聲稱精確到單字；候選可能只涉及該欄內部分文字。", "reason": "字形起筆為横折彎撇，無上橫點，筆勢作木刻'乃'字；文意對應新約聖經羅馬書6:23（罪惡之償値乃死/工價乃是死），與本頁第1欄'死亡'之'亡'字（起筆有清晰橫點）形體顯異。", "start": 0, "surface": "因罪而死、又曰、罪惡之償値、乃死、蓋禍難", "unit_id": "c03-L07"}</note>
        <note type="transcription-uncertainty" target="#c03-L01" corresp="uncertainties.json#c03-controller-unc" xml:id="c03-controller-unc">{"candidates": ["嘗思", "嘗聞"], "cause": "reading-unresolved", "end": 18, "extent": "located-unit", "id": "c03-controller-unc", "position_note": "整單位疑讀；非逐字位置認證。", "reason": "近裝訂處起首第二字印墨及遮邊不清，須高解析回圖。", "start": 0, "surface": "嘗思天道福善禍淫、疾病死亡、所以報惡", "unit_id": "c03-L01"}</note>
      </div>
      <div type="source-image" n="pp. [4]-[5]" facs="#surface-c04" xml:id="c04">
        <note type="layout">右、左兩面連續宗教前言；版心葉碼與正文分列。</note>
        <note type="layout-reviewed">true</note>
        <note type="layer-states">{"original-print": "complete"}</note>
        <ab type="preface" n="right" facs="#surface-c04" xml:id="c04-R01">死亡自省、昔耶穌誨耶路撒冷人曰、爾曹</ab>
        <ab type="preface" n="right" facs="#surface-c04" xml:id="c04-R02">不悔改、亦必死亡、可見惡必受罰、當悔改</ab>
        <ab type="preface" n="right" facs="#surface-c04" xml:id="c04-R03">求免、況死後永苦、比生前重罰尤慘、勿謂</ab>
        <ab type="preface" n="right" facs="#surface-c04" xml:id="c04-R04">天堂地獄之說爲無稽也、近世風俗、人心</ab>
        <ab type="preface" n="right" facs="#surface-c04" xml:id="c04-R05">愈降愈下、故兵燹水旱、瘟疫疾病、無地無</ab>
        <ab type="preface" n="right" facs="#surface-c04" xml:id="c04-R06">之、諸禍中、恆多者惟疾病、顯見者亦惟疾</ab>
        <ab type="preface" n="right" facs="#surface-c04" xml:id="c04-R07">病、如貪花柳者、有疳疔麻瘋患、飲酒食洋</ab>
        <ab type="preface" n="right" facs="#surface-c04" xml:id="c04-R08">煙者、有損身致病患、好勇鬪狠者、有刀傷</ab>
        <ab type="preface" n="right" facs="#surface-c04" xml:id="c04-R09">患、此種病患、皆罪所當得、外此百般病患、</ab>
        <ab type="preface" n="left" facs="#surface-c04" xml:id="c04-L01">雖良民亦有不免者、推其原、皆因初世犯</ab>
        <ab type="preface" n="left" facs="#surface-c04" xml:id="c04-L02">罪而起、使初世遵　　天父命、不食禁果、</ab>
        <ab type="preface" n="left" facs="#surface-c04" xml:id="c04-L03">便全善無惡、不至貽累後世艱苦也、我輩</ab>
        <ab type="preface" n="left" facs="#surface-c04" xml:id="c04-L04">同生覆載內、有時歷水火而得拯救、染疾</ab>
        <ab type="preface" n="left" facs="#surface-c04" xml:id="c04-L05">病而得調劑、皆　　天父鴻慈默祐、不忍</ab>
        <ab type="preface" n="left" facs="#surface-c04" xml:id="c04-L06">卽罰以死亡、令人悔改、故病者固不可自</ab>
        <ab type="preface" n="left" facs="#surface-c04" xml:id="c04-L07">誇有福、醫者亦不能自居有功也、</ab>
        <ab type="folio" n="right" facs="#surface-c04" xml:id="c04-R-folio">一</ab>
      </div>
      <div type="source-image" n="pp. [6]-[7]" facs="#surface-c05" xml:id="c05">
        <note type="layout">右面空白但有版心數字；左面〈論瘧症〉起首及小字註。</note>
        <note type="layout-reviewed">true</note>
        <note type="layer-states">{"original-print": "complete"}</note>
        <ab type="folio" n="right" facs="#surface-c05" xml:id="c05-R-folio">二</ab>
        <ab type="title" n="left" facs="#surface-c05" xml:id="c05-L01">論瘧症</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="left" facs="#surface-c05" xml:id="c05-L02">瘧症俗名打擺子、病狀、先發寒、後發熱、至</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="left" facs="#surface-c05" xml:id="c05-L03">汗出而病暫退、或每日一作、或間日一</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="left" facs="#surface-c05" xml:id="c05-L04">作、或間兩日一作、患此症者、若不善爲調</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="left" facs="#surface-c05" xml:id="c05-L05">治、久則形枯體瘦、氣餒力衰、甚至或變蠱</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="left" facs="#surface-c05" xml:id="c05-L06">脹、或腹內脾肝體大異常、卽中土醫書所</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="left" facs="#surface-c05" xml:id="c05-L07">謂、久瘧腹有痞塊、名爲瘧母是也、大抵此</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="left" facs="#surface-c05" xml:id="c05-L08">症、秋天恆多、夏天亦不少、治法、最効是用</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="left" facs="#surface-c05" xml:id="c05-L09">金雞納霜、日服四次、每次六厘、</ab>
        <ab type="note" n="left" facs="#surface-c05" xml:id="c05-L09-N01">少則不効</ab>
        <note type="transcription-uncertainty" target="#c05-L08" corresp="uncertainties.json#c05-unc-01" xml:id="c05-unc-01">{"candidates": ["効", "劾"], "cause": "reading-unresolved", "end": 20, "extent": "located-unit", "id": "c05-unc-01", "position_note": "初錄疑讀以整個定位單位標記，未聲稱精確到單字；候選可能只涉及該欄內部分文字。", "reason": "左旁從交，右旁從力，為'効'（效之異體），與次欄雙行夾註'少則不効'同字互證；非'劾'。", "start": 0, "surface": "症、秋天恆多、夏天亦不少、治法、最効是用", "unit_id": "c05-L08"}</note>
