      <div type="source-image" n="pp. [8]-[9]" facs="#surface-c06" xml:id="c06">
        <note type="layout">右、左兩面連續醫學正文，含服量與頻次；版心分列。</note>
        <note type="layout-reviewed">true</note>
        <note type="layer-states">{"original-print": "complete"}</note>
        <ab type="body" n="right" facs="#surface-c06" xml:id="c06-R01">預先五點鐘、每點鐘服一次、倘服了三次</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="right" facs="#surface-c06" xml:id="c06-R02">病或速作、不必服第四次、因病未作則可</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="right" facs="#surface-c06" xml:id="c06-R03">截、病旣作則不可截、或病者身體太弱、恐</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="right" facs="#surface-c06" xml:id="c06-R04">或隨服隨嘔、宜每次服三厘、照期分兩日</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="right" facs="#surface-c06" xml:id="c06-R05">服、旣截後、凡每日一作者、自病截日起、計</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="right" facs="#surface-c06" xml:id="c06-R06">至第七日、恐或復發、是日宜預早服此藥</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="right" facs="#surface-c06" xml:id="c06-R07">三四次、每次比前少些、自此服藥日起、又</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="right" facs="#surface-c06" xml:id="c06-R08">計至七日、仍恐復發、照式服藥、直計至第</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="right" facs="#surface-c06" xml:id="c06-R09">三四次之七日、仍須服藥、其間一日作者、</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="left" facs="#surface-c06" xml:id="c06-L01">自病截前一日起計、每至十四日或復發</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="left" facs="#surface-c06" xml:id="c06-L02">仍照式服藥以截之、又法、服信石酒一錢、</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="left" facs="#surface-c06" xml:id="c06-L03">至一錢半、須於朝晨、及作冷前、每服一次、</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="left" facs="#surface-c06" xml:id="c06-L04">亦可截、截後恐或復發、仍計七日之期以</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="left" facs="#surface-c06" xml:id="c06-L05">截之、此二法、屢試屢驗、但截後覺口苦頭</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="left" facs="#surface-c06" xml:id="c06-L06">疼、及各般身體不安、宜服輕瀉藥以鬆之、</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="left" facs="#surface-c06" xml:id="c06-L07">自然全愈、此種瘧症、常有定期、西國人多</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="left" facs="#surface-c06" xml:id="c06-L08">患此症、屢經細察、故知如此、愚見中土人</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="left" facs="#surface-c06" xml:id="c06-L09">患此症者、亦覺愈後復發、恰照定期、特中</ab>
        <ab type="folio" n="left" facs="#surface-c06" xml:id="c06-L-folio">二</ab>
        <note type="transcription-uncertainty" target="#c06-L06" corresp="uncertainties.json#c06-unc-01" xml:id="c06-unc-01">{"candidates": ["安", "寧"], "cause": "reading-unresolved", "end": 19, "extent": "located-unit", "id": "c06-unc-01", "position_note": "初錄疑讀以整個定位單位標記，未聲稱精確到單字；候選可能只涉及該欄內部分文字。", "reason": "版面有橫向木紋擦損，字形頂部從宀，下部從女，與前字'不'連讀為'身體不安'。", "start": 0, "surface": "疼、及各般身體不安、宜服輕瀉藥以鬆之、", "unit_id": "c06-L06"}</note>
        <note type="transcription-uncertainty" target="#c06-L08" corresp="uncertainties.json#c06-unc-02" xml:id="c06-unc-02">{"candidates": ["愚", "私"], "cause": "reading-unresolved", "end": 19, "extent": "located-unit", "id": "c06-unc-02", "position_note": "初錄疑讀以整個定位單位標記，未聲稱精確到單字；候選可能只涉及該欄內部分文字。", "reason": "此字較欄內正文字體略小，嵌刻於第14字'此、'與第16字'見'之間，從禺從心，錄為'愚'，句讀為'愚見中土人'。", "start": 0, "surface": "患此症、屢經細察、故知如此、愚見中土人", "unit_id": "c06-L08"}</note>
      </div>
      <div type="source-image" n="pp. [10]-[11]" facs="#surface-c07" xml:id="c07">
        <note type="layout">右、左兩面連續醫學正文，左面有價格與服次小註。</note>
        <note type="layout-reviewed">true</note>
        <note type="layer-states">{"original-print": "complete"}</note>
        <ab type="body" n="right" facs="#surface-c07" xml:id="c07-u01">土人習而不察、故以爲擺子、往來無定、歸</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="right" facs="#surface-c07" xml:id="c07-u02">咎於醫藥寡効、及戒口不淸耳、茲特將醫</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="right" facs="#surface-c07" xml:id="c07-u03">藥治法、詳晰並錄、俾知醫有妙藥、治有定</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="right" facs="#surface-c07" xml:id="c07-u04">法、而着手生春焉、並附金雞納霜信石酒</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="right" facs="#surface-c07" xml:id="c07-u05">製法於後、</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="right" facs="#surface-c07" xml:id="c07-u06">金雞納霜、出自南亞美利駕、樹名金雞納</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="right" facs="#surface-c07" xml:id="c07-u07">霜、乃其樹皮所出、西國藥肆、用價沽此</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="right" facs="#surface-c07" xml:id="c07-u08">樹皮、昔時多是研末作散、或用煎湯、近</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="right" facs="#surface-c07" xml:id="c07-u09">則多方泡製、得其樹皮之精漿、故名曰</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="left" facs="#surface-c07" xml:id="c07-u10">霜、其價頗昂、現年比前數年、價平一半、</ab>
        <ab type="note" n="left" facs="#surface-c07" xml:id="c07-u11">四大約換三</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="left" facs="#surface-c07" xml:id="c07-u12">其性不寒不熱、色白、味苦、功力</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="left" facs="#surface-c07" xml:id="c07-u13">全補、是治擺子第一妙藥也、平常發熱、</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="left" facs="#surface-c07" xml:id="c07-u14">卽潮熱、於每日熱退時、服一二分、</ab>
        <ab type="note" n="left" facs="#surface-c07" xml:id="c07-u15">兩次</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="left" facs="#surface-c07" xml:id="c07-u16">極有應驗、又凡人不論甚麼病、後欠補、</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="left" facs="#surface-c07" xml:id="c07-u17">及戒洋烟後、欠補、朝晚飯前、每服二厘、</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="left" facs="#surface-c07" xml:id="c07-u18">可補元氣、戒洋烟藥丸斷不可少此一</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="left" facs="#surface-c07" xml:id="c07-u19">味、河南鰲洲興盛行常有發兌、每樽</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="left" facs="#surface-c07" xml:id="c07-u20">約八錢、價銀二員半、如買十樽、價銀二</ab>
        <note type="transcription-uncertainty" target="#c07-u11" corresp="uncertainties.json#c07-unc-01" xml:id="c07-unc-01">{"candidates": ["四大約換三", "大約四換三"], "cause": "reading-unresolved", "end": 5, "extent": "located-unit", "id": "c07-unc-01", "position_note": "初錄疑讀以整個定位單位標記，未聲稱精確到單字；候選可能只涉及該欄內部分文字。", "reason": "左半頁第二欄頂端小字夾註，掛接於正文「價平一半、」之後。五字字形清晰可辨為『四』、『大』、『約』、『換』、『三』。因字體微縮，若依單欄由上而下排印視為『四大約換三』；若依雙行排布（右行大約、左行四換三，或右行四大約、左行換三）則讀為『大約四換三』。錄為『四大約換三』，候選『大約四換三』。", "start": 0, "surface": "四大約換三", "unit_id": "c07-u11"}</note>
