        <ab type="folio" n="right" facs="#surface-c09" xml:id="c09-u01">四</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="right" facs="#surface-c09" xml:id="c09-u02">夾住、夾之大小、須量人之肥瘦、恰合爲宜、</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="right" facs="#surface-c09" xml:id="c09-u03">愚見中土人醫此症、止用湯藥、偶可止痛、</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="right" facs="#surface-c09" xml:id="c09-u04">而不能令小腸送還本位、曷不令巧匠、照</ab>
